Error [E0201]: `consume` needs the move-capability marker `^` here — this value can't be copied
  --> tests/ui/sigil_move_capability_misuse.jet:11:13
    |
 11 |     consume(n)
    |             ^
 Why: parameter 1 takes ownership through the move-capability marker `^`; passing `n` without that marker would have to copy it, but this type can't be copied
 Fix: write the move-capability marker `^` (`^n`) to move ownership to `consume`
